---
/** Yellow "Speak at a meetup" block, used on the homepage. */
import Button from '~/components/ui/Button.astro';
---

<div class="mt-3 bg-yellow text-black rounded-block p-[clamp(24px,3.6vw,48px)] grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,340px),1fr))] gap-x-10 gap-y-5 items-center">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
    <h2 class="m-0 text-[clamp(26px,2.8vw,38px)] leading-[1.15] font-bold">Speak at a meetup</h2>
    <p class="m-0 text-[18px] leading-normal max-w-[560px]">
      Does it have to be about JavaScript? Not really. We’ve had talks on Laravel, careers, infrastructure and observability. First-time speakers are welcome, and we help you prepare.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="flex justify-end"><Button href="/cfp" variant="black">Propose a talk</Button></div>
</div>
